    "Every patient read is logged as access to their record: say so above the table.",
    "Exists for the service maternity (records): show it as GET /establishment views.screens says for screen_id obstetric_register (full; open_work: without its new work, with the banner \"No new ... from now on\"; records: history and corrections only; setup: only from Facility settings; hidden: in no menu), after login and again on establishment.changed. Never decide it from the profile's category."
